TORCH207 `torch.arange` with a float `step` may produce an inconsistent element count
 --> TORCH207.py:6:20
  |
5 | # Errors (should trigger TORCH207)
6 | torch.arange(0, 1, 0.1)
  |                    ^^^
7 | torch.arange(0.0, 5.0, 0.5)
8 | torch.arange(0, 10, step=0.25)
  |

